<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 111,000-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 111,000-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Thursday's actual receipts 111,000 head. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts $0.50 to $1.00 lower than the mid-session Thursday with an interest or so not established. Top $48.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>			   Country		  Plant</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    46.00 -47.00	   47.00 -48.00</p>
<p>few			45.50 &amp;47.50	   46.50 &amp;48.50</p>
<p>Sows - steady/off $2.00. Top $48.00. US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  40.50 -42.00	   41.00 -43.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   42.00 -43.00	   42.00 -44.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    45.00 -48.00	   46.00 -48.00</p>
